  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Distance travelled by car in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>675</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. Distance travelled by scooter in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math><math><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>450</mn></math>. Let car catches scooter in time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math><br />difference between the distance travelled by car and scooter&nbsp;in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> in<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#8658;&#8201;</mtext><mn>450</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>675</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>112.5</mn><mtext>&#8201;&#160;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>675</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>45</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math><mn>337.5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>45</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>675</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>t</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>337.5</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>22.5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>.</p>"
